            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20+EXO.12.21+EXO.12.22+EXO.12.23+EXO.12.24+EXO.12.25+EXO.12.26+EXO.12.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 12:1–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikukuu ya Chiyahudi ya Pasaka iriphofika phephi, Jesu waphiya Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika hiko, wainjira Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu na achiona atu anaguza ngʼombe, mangʼondzi na njiya. Piya waona atu okala asegere mezani anagaluza pesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wasuka chikoto achiatuluza kondze hara atu phamwenga na ngʼombe na mangʼondzi. Achipendula-pendula meza za ariokala anagaluza pesa, na pesa zao zichimwagika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiagalukira hara aguzao njiya, na achiaambira kpwa usiru, “Tuluzani vitu vyenu! Nyumba ya Baba msiihende chete!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 69:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anafundzie ariphosikira hivyo, atambukira Maandiko gaambago, “Mendzwa nriyo nayo kpwa sababu ya nyumbayo indanirya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi vilongozi a Chiyahudi amuuza Jesu, “Undahuonyesa chilinje chani hata humanye una uwezo wa kuhenda gosi higa uhendago?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.61"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 26:61",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.58"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 14:58",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiaambira, “Ivundzeni hino Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu nami nindaidzenga tsona kpwa siku tahu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuamba, “Dzengo rohala miaka mirongo mine na sita kusira, uridzenge kpwa siku tahu? Iyo taiwezekana bii!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyumba ambayo Jesu kala anabisha habarize, kala ni mwiriwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ariphofufulwa, anafundzie atambukira kukala maneno higa wagagomba. Nao achiamini higo Maandiko na higo ambago Jesu kala akaambira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
